SECTION 5 - Power to amend the Schedule

  The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedule by adding, removing or varying any entry, but no such order shall increase a maximum term of imprisonment beyond ten years.

SECTION 6 - Transitional

  Any proceedings commenced before the date on which this Act comes into operation shall be continued and determined as if this Act had not been passed.
